e loves fortune-telling. For some reason, she believes that the main character is her destined one. She approaches him modestly and aggressively with her wealth. She is naive and has a natural air of stupidity. She is the daughter of a big conglomerate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is concerned about superstitions and jinxes. Her favorite book is a certain magazine from Gakken. She collects good luck items and accessories from mail-order stores. She has a strong sense of belief. She is easily heated and easily cooled."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is estranged from her parents and family, who are busy with their work, and she is a lonely person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11193"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の女学生。なおのクラスメートで大の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占い好き。何故か主人公を運命の人と信じ、財力に物を言わせ控えかつ過激にアプローチしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで天然ボケ気味。迷信やジンクスを気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛読書は学研の某雑誌。また、通販の開運グッズやらアクセサリーを収集している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思い込みが激しいが、熱しやすく冷めやすい性格でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事に忙殺されている両親や家族とは疎遠で、さびしい思いをしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"3945","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【深窓の令乳、お騒がせ財閥娘】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"肉まん型。Ｆカップ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オカルト大好き御令嬢・みつぐの周りでは、ＵＦＯ・怪物・怪しい黒服の男達が入り乱れて、毎日がてんやわんやの大騒ぎ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"脱いでもすごいお嬢様は、なおを交えた３ＰやコスプレＨで大介を翻弄！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックなみつぐに振り回されつつも、自分への真剣な気持ちを知り、戸惑う大介……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな時、みつぐが大切にしていた御守りを失くした事で、暗雲が……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の女学生。なおのクラスメートで大の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"占い好き。何故か主人公を運命の人と信じ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"財力に物を言わせ控えかつ過激にアプローチしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで天然ボケ気味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"財力に物を言わせ控えめかつ過激にアプローチしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで天然ボケ気味。大財閥の令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"迷信やジンクスを気にする。愛読書は学研の某雑誌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通販の開運グッズやらアクセサリーを収集している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思い込みが激しい。熱しやすく冷めやすい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事に忙殺されている両親や家族とは疎遠で、さびしがり屋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44425"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"47 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"bust":[{"comparisonValue":"89","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11193","value":"89"},{"comparisonValue":"89","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"3945","value":"89"},{"comparisonValue":"86","scope":"sourceWork","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22702","sourceWorkId":"7172","value":"86"},{"comparisonValue":"86","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44425","value":"86"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2cc6f4e61c60bb92c6b0de21faf0e6497079218f5102dd7755a1057f1608eb67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9ff56adb0575666a3b1558bab4b8e4caa6d3d7f493d13af0a8f274621dffba2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[